TI  - Integrating Deep Learning with Symbolic Reasoning: A NeuroSymbolic Framework for Trustworthy Medical Diagnosis
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 IEEE International Conference on Emerging Computing and Intelligent Technologies, ICoECIT 2026
DO  - 10.1109/ICoECIT68303.2026.11497919
