TI  - Deep Learning vs. Traditional Machine Learning in the Diagnosis of Cutaneous Drug Eruptions: A Comparative Study with Explainable AI on Whole-Slide Images
PY  - 2026
T2  - Journal of Imaging Informatics in Medicine
