TI  - DenseSwinLight: A Hybrid CNN-Transformer Model with Lightweight Post-hoc Fusion for Visual Explainability
PY  - 2026
T2  - 12th 2026 International Conference on Control, Decision and Information Technologies, CoDIT 2026
SP  - 782
EP  - 789
DO  - 10.1109/CoDIT70676.2026.11631087
