TI  - A global model-agnostic rule-based XAI method based on Parameterized Event Primitives for time series classifiers
PY  - 2024
T2  - Frontiers in Artificial Intelligence
VL  - 7
C7  - 1381921
DO  - 10.3389/frai.2024.1381921
